# JavaScript bundle, in serve order. THIS FILE IS THE SOURCE OF TRUTH.
#
# The browser receives ONE js file, concatenated from these in this order.
# The order is load-bearing twice: a module that calls another while rendering
# must come after it, and the card layer must come last in the CSS or the
# per-module panels win at equal specificity.
#
# It used to live in the assets[] arrays in web_server.c, with CMakeLists.txt
# listing the same files in a DIFFERENT order and tools/ui_preview_order.json
# holding a third copy. Three lists meant three chances to disagree, and a
# disagreement is invisible until a page silently stops working. Now the build
# reads this file, the firmware serves what the build produced, and the preview
# reads the same file -- so there is nothing left to keep in step.
#
# Blank lines and # comments are ignored. Paths are relative to web/.


